ant for the  development of her character if wanda is  indeed going to be a villain in the  second doctor strange film the scarlet  witch is a much more menacing name  than just wanda and to that end i think  up to now the character has kind of  taken a backseat in terms of popularity  because she didn't have  any sort of nickname if fans didn't read  comics they might have no idea that she  was ever called scarlet witch so the  fact that she just went by her first  name was kind of odd i mean you have  characters called iron man captain  america black panther and  wanda so finally calling her the scarlet  witch significantly up to a coolness  factor  if nothing else and so this brings us to  our number one moment in the entire  series and for this video we're going  off script  this moment is wanda maximoff delving  into the dark hold  and this is a huge moment in the show  and the reason why is because  wanda doesn't know what she's doing and  that's why it's so cool it's because  wanda was just told by agatha there's  this book called the dark hole and this  dark hold will teach you how to use your  powers there's no understanding of the  significance of the dark hole there's no  knowledge of what it has its ties to she  literally just opens up a book that's  called the book of the damned and just  starts reading it this has  huge implications for the marvel  cinematic universe first and foremost if  the book really does have ties to  catholic that she's unwittingly  allowing herself to be influenced by  catholic's power that seems to be the  case because of the fact that she heard  her kids cry out and it's entirely  possible that catholic is influencing  her and then in turn will basically take  her over and then possess her in order  to use her for his own  end if that happens the entire marvel  cinematic universe is  because things are going to be crazy  right the level of power that's going to  be shown there is going to be unlike  anything that we've ever seen before  the other big thing that comes out of  this is that wanda is learning how to  use all these expansive powers that she  has  and agatha states broadly for us to know  the scarlet witch's power is beyond  that of steven strange and that means  that even if wanda ends up becoming a  bad guy  somehow survives the entire ordeal and  the marvel cinematic universe decides  not to kill her off like they've done  with so many of their villains and she  basically arrives back at avengers  mansion and goes forward as a good guy  with the full totality of her powers  that means the marvel cinematic universe  is gonna have to create stories that can  complement all those powers that she has  which means  bigger and better villains this is a  huge moment because it means that wanda  by exploring the full totality of our  powers and learning how to use them  is in effect a walking talking infinity  gauntlet i  love this but with that being said guys  we're gonna bring this video to an end  let us  know if you loved our top five list give  us your own list if you guys disagree  with any other and we will catch you all  later  peace

